  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEPFAR: Fambidzanai Permaculture Centre Borehole Drilling Garden</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BOREHOLE DRILLING AND NUTRITION GARDEN ESTABLISHMENT. MOST OF THE PARENTS AT THE SCHOOL, SOME OF WHOM ARE LIVING WITH HIV STRUGGLE TO PAY SCHOOL FEES DUE TO ECONOMIC CHALLENGES. TO IMPROVE THE QUALITY OF LIFE FOR THE SCHOOL PUPILS THROUGH WATER ACCESS.</narrative>
